{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12322","headline":"山园秋晚寄杜黄裳少府 · 钱起","name":"山园秋晚寄杜黄裳少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惆怅佳期阻，园林秋景闲。\n终朝碧云外，唯见暮禽还。\n泉石思携手，烟霞不闭关。\n杖藜仍把菊，对卷也看山。\n望望离心起，非君谁解颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}